{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_874.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"052f3b51941149af8d2609e15db53cb32d5474293678bfe10436d25a9746d919","ja":"んー？　なんだい、亜美さんや。","zh":"嗯？怎么了，亚美？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_874.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"de5031eee9c3a82cf06515fd94e63e7bb244dfa1679f4115a6cdf272428ed1cb","ja":"今日の練習前に、律っちゃんに宿題出さないといけない\nっしょ？　亜美やってないから、ちょっと見せて。","zh":"今天练习前得把作业交给律子，对吧？亚美还没做，给我看一下。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_874.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"38de2b6e05089660c5a0292c3168be1519f4095bfbbc36afd8397aac3e5007e6","ja":"えっ？　……真美もやってないよ。","zh":"咦？……真美也没做哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_874.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1cf63e7acee0f1c5b7944d8d90f8552ca76b29ee7393816fc5a5243c690b5716","ja":"なんですとーっ！？　終わってないのに、\n昨日あんなにゲームしてたの！？","zh":"什么——！？明明还没结束，昨天居然玩了那么久游戏！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_874.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"686b71f4d10ebe4e216901581b3d74f2332adc3ce2805b6667748791fed1bf19","ja":"そう言う亜美だって、\n昨日ずっとマンガ読んでたじゃん！？","zh":"说这种话的亚美，昨天不也一直在看漫画嘛！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_874.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"fb99fa6e7fe861a5b952512ed140bf114d974aedc1b2dfafd7f0d0dca7c6e941","ja":"そ、それは……、\n真美に写させてもらおうって思ってたから……。","zh":"那、那个……因为我本来想让真美借我抄一下……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_874.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a2b4a3f7160192480478de14f0a8a3c29fa04f57bfe6f787e0306fe367c8a22a","ja":"真美だって、亜美に写させてもらおうと\n思ってたのにーっ！","zh":"我还想着让亚美给我抄呢——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_874.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"62e02bc17b55a7fbd6540ecab23536202e45714010a7a70353b740d107f852ee","ja":"う、うあうあ……どうしよう……。","zh":"呜、呜哇呜哇……怎么办……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_874.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a9a4102ef6db92639ea951ffc54b838a88580239d239f69e2cfbf0763a23157f","ja":"これ、律っちゃん激おこコースだよね……。\n危機百万発だよ～……。","zh":"这算是律子暴怒路线吧……。\n真是危机百万发啊～……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_874.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"5bb8aff12e9258d13f2954b16f239223760346b6f5e437b13e88381c310c83f6","ja":"かくなる上は……\n何か別のことで、律っちゃんの気をそらすしかない！","zh":"既然如此……\n只能用别的事情转移律子的注意力了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
